# Declared 2x7 S0 time-chain DetectorErrorModel (Stim format).
# Detectors D0..D6 = rounds R0..R6. Observables L0..L7 label fault ids so
# PyMatching.decode returns prediction vectors comparable to the fixture table.
# Not full spacetime MWPM for the 3-qubit code.
error(0.1) D0 D1 L0
error(0.1) D1 D2 L1
error(0.1) D2 D3 L2
error(0.1) D3 D4 L3
error(0.1) D4 D5 L4
error(0.1) D5 D6 L5
error(0.01) D0 L6
error(0.2) D6 L7
